(UPPER-CASE)
*TITLE Case-insensitive free-field input
*ATMOS NONE
*EARTH SPHERICAL, GM=0, OMEGA=0
*TRAJECTORY 1 VEHICLE START ON 1
  *INITIAL ECFC X=2.09256463255E7, Y=0, Z=0, XDT=0, YDT=0, ZDT=0, TIME=0, MASS=1
  *FILE lexical.dat TIME XECFC XECFCDT THRUST
  *SEGMENT 1 BURN
    *INTEG DTPRNT=2.5E-1, DT=2.5E-2
    *INERTIAL ECFC
    *PROP THRUST=(UPPER-THRUST) # mixed delimiters and comments are intentional
    *FLY YAWI=0
    *FLY PITCHI=0
    *FLY ROLLI=0
    *WHEN TIME=1 STOP
*END
